Begin "Verify 'View Inventory' permission"
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Control Panel" sidemenu entry
	Click the "Access" charttab
	Click the "Access Control" charttab subtab
	Type "selenium" in the input
	Click the "Go!" button
	# in the "Username" cell in the "selenium" row in the "WebChart Users" table
	Click the "selenium" link
	# in the "Access Control (selenium)" box
	Verify !exists the "[ View Inventory: No ]" text
Begin "Set setting to Show Drug Classes"
	Click the "System" charttab
	Click the "System Settings" charttab subtab
	Type "Show Drug Classes" in the "select_text" input
	Click the "Go" button
	# in the "Value" cell in the "Show Drug Classes" row in the "System Settings" table
	Verify exists the !"Enabled" text
Begin "Verify Bug #16204 is fixed"
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Inventory" sidemenu entry
	Click the "Weekly Review" charttab
	Verify exists The "General Inventory Review" text
	Verify exists The "Patient Assistance Inventory Review" text
